{"seq":53,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1986"},"reason":"The body claimed that the post-war (1950) postal spelling table kept all the Nazi-era replacements, so that Germans spelled with Siegfried and Zeppelin for seven decades. In fact the 1950 table restored Samuel and Zacharias; only Dora and Nordpol (the replacements for David and Nathan) stayed until DIN 5009:2022. Intro, the 1950 paragraph and the S/Z rows of the table corrected in EN/DE/RU.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.schwender.in-berlin.de/buchstabiertafel.html"},{"url":"https://austria-forum.org/af/Wissenssammlungen/Essays/Geschichte/Buchstabieren_und_Politik"},{"url":"https://www.tagesspiegel.de/kultur/schweres-umlernen-4304617.html"},{"url":"https://www.buchstabieralphabet.org/"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",38],["-","Nordpol,"],["+","Nordpol.“"],["=",1],["-","S wie Siegfried.“ "],["=",10],["-","three"],["+","two"],["=",403],["-","returned."],["+","returned;"],["=",1],["+","Samuel and Zacharias were restored too. "],["=",2],["+","Dora and Nordpol, "],["=",6],["-","the"],["+","David"],["=",1],["-","Jewish"],["+","and"],["=",1],["-","names"],["+","Nathan,"],["=",31],["-","Dora,"],["+","Dora"],["=",1],["-","Nordpol, Siegfried "],["=",2],["-","Zeppelin,"],["+","Nordpol,"],["=",571],["-","Siegfried"],["+","Samuel"],["=",43],["-","Zeppelin"],["+","Zacharias"],["=",60]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",34],["-","Nordpol,"],["+","Nordpol.“"],["=",1],["-","S wie Siegfried.“ "],["=",10],["-","drei"],["+","beiden"],["=",353],["-","zurück."],["+","zurück;"],["=",1],["-","Die"],["+","auch"],["=",1],["+","Samuel und Zacharias wurden wieder aufgenommen. Dora und Nordpol, die "],["=",4],["-","die"],["+","David"],["=",1],["-","jüdischen"],["+","und"],["=",1],["-","Namen"],["+","Nathan,"],["=",35],["-","Dora,"],["+","Dora"],["=",1],["-","Nordpol, Siegfried "],["=",2],["-","Zeppelin,"],["+","Nordpol,"],["=",533],["-","Siegfried"],["+","Samue